Developer -@app.get on a function-> FastAPI
note right of FastAPI
  FastAPI.get returns self.router.get(...) (applications.py:2035).
FastAPI -router.get-> APIRouter
APIRouter -api_route returns a decorator-> APIRouter
APIRouter -decorator calls add_api_route-> APIRouter
note right of APIRouter
  decorator at routing.py:3108 calls add_api_route at 3109.
  Prefix, tags, dependencies and callbacks are merged first (routing.py:3030-3043).
APIRouter -route_class(prefix + path, endpoint, ...)-> APIRoute
APIRoute -_populate_api_route_state-> APIRoute
note right of APIRoute
